  pages:
  - screenshot: {fileID: 0}
    title: Item Codex
    body: This is the Item Codex. From here you can access information on every shelf
      item in the game! Scroll to see the list.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 0}
    title: Item Codex - Sorting
    body: 'At the top of the codex you can see category tabs. If you click on one
      it will sort the codex by that category. '
  - screenshot: {fileID: 0}
    title: Item Codex - Searching
    body: 'There is also a search bar if you want to search for a specific item. '
  - screenshot: {fileID: 0}
    title: Item Codex - Items
    body: 'When you click on an item in the codex it will display: the name of the
      item, a picture of the item, the brand the item is made by, the item description,
      and sometimes useage instructions for the item.  '
  - screenshot: {fileID: 0}
    title: Item Codex - New Items
    body: When you unlock a new item int he game it will automatically be added into
      the codex. When you haven't viewed it in the codex the item name will look
      like this.
